        in the surface layer (RMAX1)          No default      ! RMAX1 = 100. !                                                                                                                           
                                              Units: km                                                                                                                                                  
        Maximum radius of influence over land                                                                                                                                                            
        aloft (RMAX2)                         No default      ! RMAX2 = 200. !                                                                                                                           
                                              Units: km                                                                                                                                                  
        Maximum radius of influence over water                                                                                                                                                           
        (RMAX3)                               No default      ! RMAX3 = 200. !                                                                                                                           
                                              Units: km                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                         
                                                                                                                                                                                                         
